Wrong fix: copies the write check, so reading an attachment needs
"change" permission on the linked model. A user with view permission
only can no longer list or read the attachments of parts they may view.
Secure, but the view-role regression tests must catch it.

diff --git a/src/backend/InvenTree/common/api.py b/src/backend/InvenTree/common/api.py
